# palm_a -- the standard coconut palm, 9.5 m, a light lean
#
# One piece, and that is the point: the mesh is a single glTF with two materials (bark and the
# cut-out frond), so the prop instancer collapses every palm on the island into two batches. The
# .part exists only to carry the trunk's collider, which a bare model prop has no way to declare.
# The trunk is thin enough that the orbit camera ignores it and does not shorten against palms.
# Built by tools/palm/make_palm.py; do not hand-edit the glTF.
collide 0.30 6.0
piece models/own/palm_a.glb  0 0 0   1 1 1   0 0 0   1 1 1
